          "outputs_schema": {},
          "prompt_template": "Read __authoring__/review-proposal.json and analysis/review-request.txt completely with read_workflow_resource_chunk: start each at byte 0 and follow next_byte until complete. Read __authoring__/review-inputs-schema.json and __authoring__/review-facts.json once. Review the exact canonical proposal against the full source, resource/callable/dependency inventory, future inputs and ordered shared checklist. Check both directions: every required behavior remains usable, and added work has a source or user basis. Preserve original tools, transports, arguments, stdin/file contracts, triggers, checks, local repair loops and approvals; reject unnecessary stages and repeated mechanical observations. Assess actual responsibility boundaries, complete data handoffs and reusable artifacts. Main inherits the initiating Pi model; ordinary Main work has fresh isolated context. Independent review may use a fresh read-only Main worker unless the source requires another Provider. Inspect structured downstream repair loops, bounded rounds, positional item verdicts, accepted-item preservation and final acceptance outside. Treat unused absent fields as Host-normalized empties. Compact facts bind the proposal hash, actual disjoint evidence, exact source interfaces and finite domains; they never approve semantics. Resource read grants do not cite every line, and a validated required finite selector may give its remaining valid value to a default arm. Distinguish semantic omissions from Host projection defects. For a defective Host field or completion gate, begin evidence with \"Host projection defect:\"; never ask the planner to edit IDs, spans, schemas, manifests, pointers, bindings, models or receipts. Any Host-owned failure blocks a planner retry, including mixed verdicts. Return exactly one verdict per displayed checklist entry in order, containing only status (pass, fail or not_applicable) and concise newly written evidence. Do not transcribe supplied identities, paths, hashes, source text or metadata. Report all material findings with the smallest semantic correction; assess the entire interacting correction set on repair. Use not_applicable only where the stated contract permits it. Negative findings are valid review data; malformed verdicts must be corrected in the same turn. Do not execute the source, repair the graph, override deterministic failures or declare approval. The Host computes qualification and retains the Draft for explicit human publication."
